  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A spaceship, in circular orbit around a planet, decides to turn on its engines and move into an orbit with a larger radius. What is the change in the total energy of the spaceship and what is true about the work done by the engines?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Work done by the engines</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Negative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Increases</td>\n<td>Positive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n<td>Negative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Decreases</td>\n<td>Positive</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
